1
00:00:24,039 --> 00:00:25,559
Thanks to you,

2
00:00:26,239 --> 00:00:27,480
the two batches of Heart of the Venom

3
00:00:27,839 --> 00:00:28,600
are ready.

4
00:00:31,920 --> 00:00:33,039
This Heart of the Venom

5
00:00:33,479 --> 00:00:34,479
is a mother-son pair.

6
00:00:35,280 --> 00:00:36,200
The one who takes the son pill

7
00:00:36,479 --> 00:00:38,640
will be controlled by the one who takes the mother pill.

8
00:00:39,399 --> 00:00:41,159
Only death can free them.

9
00:00:41,719 --> 00:00:43,719
When the mother dies, the son must follow.

10
00:00:47,520 --> 00:00:48,439
Which one

11
00:00:48,799 --> 00:00:49,600
is the son pill?

12
00:00:50,280 --> 00:00:51,039
My Lady,

13
00:00:51,799 --> 00:00:54,399
the lighter one is the son pill.

14
00:01:01,280 --> 00:01:02,000
The pills are ready.

15
00:01:02,359 --> 00:01:03,679
I hope you keep your promise

16
00:01:03,960 --> 00:01:04,760
and let me go.

17
00:01:16,920 --> 00:01:17,959
You are a liar.

18
00:01:19,879 --> 00:01:21,159
We are both Blue Phoenix Maidens.

19
00:01:21,879 --> 00:01:23,519
Why is one so cunning,

20
00:01:24,400 --> 00:01:26,159
and the other so dull?

21
00:01:27,519 --> 00:01:29,000
You know my secret

22
00:01:29,640 --> 00:01:31,239
and have such a wonderful ability.

23
00:01:32,200 --> 00:01:34,719
How could I let you go?

24
00:01:43,599 --> 00:01:44,799
Since I can't get the world

25
00:01:44,799 --> 00:01:45,959
from you,

26
00:01:47,079 --> 00:01:47,799
I'll

27
00:01:48,439 --> 00:01:49,840
get it myself.

28
00:03:02,520 --> 00:03:03,319
This book

29
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:05,560
is harder to understand than my postgraduate entrance exam materials.

30
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:08,280
What beauty and anti-aging,

31
00:03:08,280 --> 00:03:09,599
and methods to enhance memory,

32
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:10,960
are all vague.

33
00:03:11,280 --> 00:03:11,680
And the characters

34
00:03:12,199 --> 00:03:13,479
are small and dense.

35
00:03:13,759 --> 00:03:14,919
It makes my head ache.

36
00:03:16,240 --> 00:03:16,960
I think,

37
00:03:17,479 --> 00:03:18,400
the wizards of the Qinglou State

38
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:19,560
are probably all nearsighted.

39
00:03:20,039 --> 00:03:20,840
It's all because of these books.

40
00:03:23,520 --> 00:03:24,360
Then don't read it.

41
00:03:25,319 --> 00:03:25,879
No.

42
00:03:26,199 --> 00:03:27,800
What if there's a way

43
00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:29,039
to cure your soul

44
00:03:29,039 --> 00:03:29,560
in it?

45
00:03:30,479 --> 00:03:31,280
Whether there is a date or not,

46
00:03:31,800 --> 00:03:32,759
let's play two rounds first.

47
00:03:35,680 --> 00:03:36,280
You can't eat it.

48
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:38,439
When we first met,

49
00:03:39,159 --> 00:03:40,000
you didn't like me

50
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:40,680
peeling seeds for you.

51
00:03:41,680 --> 00:03:42,439
It's my fault.

52
00:03:43,159 --> 00:03:44,080
I didn't know better at that time.

53
00:03:44,759 --> 00:03:45,800
I don't know if it's too late

54
00:03:46,120 --> 00:03:46,960
to apologize now.

55
00:03:48,840 --> 00:03:49,680
That's more like it.

56
00:03:52,319 --> 00:03:52,919
Shen Li,

57
00:03:53,719 --> 00:03:54,319
what are you doing?

58
00:03:55,879 --> 00:03:56,759
Your scissors are too small.

59
00:03:58,360 --> 00:03:59,120
Let me help you.

60
00:03:59,639 --> 00:04:00,080
Go away.

61
00:04:00,319 --> 00:04:01,039
I don't need your help.

62
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:02,039
Just stand there and don't move.

63
00:04:02,199 --> 00:04:02,719
Look.

64
00:04:03,360 --> 00:04:04,439
Shen Li, the fool,

65
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:06,520
looks quite imposing usually.

66
00:04:07,120 --> 00:04:08,240
But when it comes to Su,

67
00:04:08,599 --> 00:04:09,599
he's like a hen.

68
00:04:10,599 --> 00:04:11,199
Gu Jiachen,

69
00:04:12,520 --> 00:04:13,560
these days

70
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:14,919
are actually quite nice.

71
00:04:15,840 --> 00:04:17,000
No fighting,

72
00:04:17,560 --> 00:04:18,800
no scheming,

73
00:04:19,360 --> 00:04:21,000
just basking in the sun and cracking seeds.

74
00:04:21,759 --> 00:04:23,399
You peel for me, and I'll peel for you.

75
00:04:25,040 --> 00:04:26,560
I have never been so comfortable

76
00:04:27,040 --> 00:04:28,040
in my life and previous life.

77
00:04:29,040 --> 00:04:30,040
Nonsense.

78
00:04:32,720 --> 00:04:33,040
But

79
00:04:34,120 --> 00:04:34,720
I think so.

80
00:04:40,199 --> 00:04:40,759
What's wrong with you?

81
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:44,279
Nothing.

82
00:04:48,600 --> 00:04:49,480
Your Royal Highness,

83
00:04:49,680 --> 00:04:50,560
His Majesty called you urgently.

84
00:04:50,720 --> 00:04:52,639
Please go to the Palace of Supreme Harmony immediately.

85
00:04:56,519 --> 00:04:56,920
Okay.

86
00:04:57,600 --> 00:04:58,480
I'll go right away.

87
00:05:03,519 --> 00:05:04,240
I'll be back in a while.

88
00:06:06,120 --> 00:06:07,120
Father, you summoned me here.

89
00:06:08,120 --> 00:06:08,879
Is there anything important?

90
00:06:11,160 --> 00:06:11,920
Let's go.

91
00:06:19,800 --> 00:06:20,959
Go.

92
00:06:24,279 --> 00:06:24,959
Your Majesty,

93
00:06:26,279 --> 00:06:27,879
the Crown Prince rarely comes here.

94
00:06:28,279 --> 00:06:30,040
Why did you let him go so easily?

95
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:36,600
Your Highness,

96
00:06:37,279 --> 00:06:37,920
what do you mean by this?

97
00:06:39,360 --> 00:06:40,079
What do I mean?

98
00:06:41,160 --> 00:06:41,839
Your Royal Highness,

99
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:44,040
you are

100
00:06:44,480 --> 00:06:45,879
getting more disobedient.

101
00:06:46,360 --> 00:06:47,560
I'm here

102
00:06:47,800 --> 00:06:48,680
to give you

103
00:06:48,720 --> 00:06:50,240
one last chance.

104
00:06:51,360 --> 00:06:53,600
[A thousand flowers bloom.]

105
00:06:55,439 --> 00:06:56,639
[The poisoned]

106
00:06:57,519 --> 00:06:59,959
[will die when the incense burns out.]

107
00:07:00,639 --> 00:07:02,160
[Only with the Nightshade Grass]

108
00:07:02,439 --> 00:07:04,000
[and the Red Aconite Flower as guides,]

109
00:07:05,079 --> 00:07:08,160
[the blood of a Holy Maiden can detoxify.]

110
00:07:42,839 --> 00:07:44,040
That's how I detoxified

111
00:07:44,040 --> 00:07:44,680
myself.

112
00:07:45,399 --> 00:07:46,319
How did you find

113
00:07:47,160 --> 00:07:47,920
the antidote

114
00:07:47,920 --> 00:07:48,600
in such a thick book?

115
00:07:49,360 --> 00:07:50,319
Yue Xuan

116
00:07:51,160 --> 00:07:52,279
is really lucky.

117
00:07:55,439 --> 00:07:58,439
Use the blood of a young girl as a catalyst,

118
00:07:59,879 --> 00:08:01,920
with seven poisons and seven herbs,

119
00:08:02,480 --> 00:08:04,399
refine for 49 days,

120
00:08:04,839 --> 00:08:06,279
and the Heart Poison Pill is complete.

121
00:08:07,600 --> 00:08:08,959
Mother and child as one.

122
00:08:25,160 --> 00:08:26,040
Didn't you get enough rest?

123
00:08:26,399 --> 00:08:27,480
You look pale.

124
00:08:28,519 --> 00:08:30,680
Maids have been disappearing lately.

125
00:08:30,759 --> 00:08:32,120
People are scared.

126
00:08:32,639 --> 00:08:33,879
They say it's haunted.

127
00:08:35,320 --> 00:08:36,039
I'm scared too.

128
00:08:36,440 --> 00:08:37,600
How can I sleep?

129
00:08:38,440 --> 00:08:39,720
Maiden missing?

130
00:08:41,039 --> 00:08:41,879
When did this happen?

131
00:08:43,399 --> 00:08:44,519
About the time

132
00:08:44,879 --> 00:08:47,000
you returned from your journey.

133
00:08:50,480 --> 00:08:51,399
That witch

134
00:08:51,639 --> 00:08:53,480
has been experimenting on maidens for long.

135
00:08:54,120 --> 00:08:55,639
Since her escape from the Spring Breeze,

136
00:08:55,759 --> 00:08:56,559
no news has been heard of her.

137
00:08:56,879 --> 00:08:57,799
She's nowhere to be found.

138
00:08:58,200 --> 00:08:59,440
Within the territory of the Li State,

139
00:08:59,679 --> 00:09:00,399
how could she

140
00:09:00,519 --> 00:09:02,159
escape from Gu Jiachen's pursuit?

141
00:09:03,120 --> 00:09:04,679
With maidens disappearing one after another,

142
00:09:05,720 --> 00:09:06,840
As the head of the harem,

143
00:09:07,120 --> 00:09:08,360
Xiao Yunshang

144
00:09:08,360 --> 00:09:09,559
should have taken notice.

145
00:09:11,039 --> 00:09:12,519
It's too much of a coincidence.

146
00:09:14,440 --> 00:09:16,720
If they are working together...

147
00:09:20,840 --> 00:09:21,360
Oh, no!

148
00:09:23,159 --> 00:09:24,519
This is the finest deer antler pill

149
00:09:24,600 --> 00:09:25,639
from the Western Regions.

150
00:09:25,799 --> 00:09:26,879
It can replenish vital energy.

151
00:09:27,200 --> 00:09:28,559
It's hard for me to get it.

152
00:09:29,399 --> 00:09:30,720
I'm here to offer it to you.

153
00:09:31,279 --> 00:09:32,120
As a tribute,

154
00:09:32,840 --> 00:09:34,120
it should be checked by the court physician.

155
00:09:35,440 --> 00:09:36,399
Your Majesty is gravely ill.

156
00:09:36,759 --> 00:09:37,840
We can't wait for the physician.

157
00:09:38,159 --> 00:09:38,639
What?

158
00:09:38,960 --> 00:09:40,120
Are you hoping

159
00:09:40,440 --> 00:09:42,039
His Majesty will pass away soon

160
00:09:42,320 --> 00:09:44,440
so you can take the throne?

161
00:09:48,279 --> 00:09:49,840
If you suspect me,

162
00:09:51,600 --> 00:09:54,679
we can both test the medicine.

163
00:10:03,440 --> 00:10:05,559
You're becoming more and more ungrateful,

164
00:10:06,399 --> 00:10:08,399
not even listening to me.

165
00:10:09,759 --> 00:10:10,960
I might as well

166
00:10:11,679 --> 00:10:14,639
find a way to extend His Majesty's life.

167
00:10:15,159 --> 00:10:17,279
Maybe I can even give birth to a son

168
00:10:17,799 --> 00:10:19,320
and name a new Crown Prince.

169
00:10:20,080 --> 00:10:20,600
Wait.

170
00:10:24,960 --> 00:10:26,639
This fine deer antler pill

171
00:10:27,440 --> 00:10:29,240
is a bargain for you today.

172
00:10:30,159 --> 00:10:31,559
If you want to test it,

173
00:10:32,799 --> 00:10:33,720
go ahead.

174
00:10:40,279 --> 00:10:41,440
Is this pill

175
00:10:42,480 --> 00:10:43,840
really from the West?

176
00:10:48,960 --> 00:10:50,120
Gu Jiachen, don't eat it.

177
00:10:52,799 --> 00:10:53,159
Don't eat it.

178
00:10:53,519 --> 00:10:55,080
How dare you destroy the pill?

179
00:10:55,279 --> 00:10:56,039
That's a capital offense.

180
00:10:56,120 --> 00:10:56,879
What pill?

181
00:10:57,240 --> 00:10:58,279
It's clearly a poison pill.

182
00:10:59,480 --> 00:11:00,799
Gu Jiachen is mine.

183
00:11:01,240 --> 00:11:02,399
Do you think I agreed

184
00:11:02,639 --> 00:11:03,360
to make him your puppet?

185
00:11:05,120 --> 00:11:05,480
You!

186
00:11:09,919 --> 00:11:11,200
Qinglouan witchcraft!

187
00:11:13,879 --> 00:11:14,279
Guards!

188
00:11:14,559 --> 00:11:15,159
Stop them!

189
00:11:17,279 --> 00:11:18,480
Hurry and feed the living insect

190
00:11:18,679 --> 00:11:19,519
to His Majesty!

191
00:11:21,840 --> 00:11:22,320
Father!

192
00:11:29,879 --> 00:11:30,480
Gu Jichen,

193
00:11:31,320 --> 00:11:32,159
since you are unwilling

194
00:11:32,200 --> 00:11:33,200
to be my puppet,

195
00:11:33,759 --> 00:11:34,919
then you and your father

196
00:11:35,480 --> 00:11:36,480
will both die!

197
00:11:41,240 --> 00:11:42,320
Deliver my oral edict!

198
00:11:45,279 --> 00:11:46,720
Deliver my oral edict!

199
00:11:48,039 --> 00:11:50,200
The disgraced consort Feng

200
00:11:50,480 --> 00:11:53,600
in the Cold Palace

201
00:11:53,759 --> 00:11:55,200
shows no remorse,

202
00:11:55,200 --> 00:11:57,120
and has seduced the Crown Prince.

203
00:11:57,120 --> 00:11:59,759
She is to be executed immediately!

204
00:12:00,120 --> 00:12:02,000
The Crown Prince, Gu Jiachen,

205
00:12:02,039 --> 00:12:03,759
has been bewitched by the sorceress.

206
00:12:03,759 --> 00:12:06,080
He is to be deposed,

207
00:12:06,240 --> 00:12:08,320
and taken into custody!

208
00:12:10,840 --> 00:12:11,360
Your Highness!

209
00:12:13,840 --> 00:12:14,240
Shen Li,

210
00:12:15,720 --> 00:12:16,879
how is the situation in the palace?

211
00:12:17,080 --> 00:12:17,879
The guards have been changed,

212
00:12:18,480 --> 00:12:20,559
and most are under the control of the Noble Consort.

213
00:12:20,879 --> 00:12:21,759
Thanks to Lady Feng

214
00:12:22,200 --> 00:12:23,519
alerting Su to send a message,

215
00:12:23,879 --> 00:12:25,440
I was able to arrive in time.

216
00:12:26,320 --> 00:12:26,720
Retreat!

217
00:12:27,399 --> 00:12:28,360
By the Empress's decree,

218
00:12:28,559 --> 00:12:29,759
anyone who encounters the Crown Prince

219
00:12:30,159 --> 00:12:30,679
and the witch must be captured!

220
00:12:30,919 --> 00:12:31,559
Close the city gates!

221
00:12:31,759 --> 00:12:32,320
Yes!

222
00:12:44,639 --> 00:12:46,080
My Lady, Crown Prince, get in the carriage!

223
00:12:46,200 --> 00:12:46,840
Go, go!

224
00:12:48,320 --> 00:12:48,840
Take them away!

225
00:12:49,159 --> 00:12:49,360
Yes!

226
00:12:49,360 --> 00:12:50,279
Aren't you coming with us?

227
00:12:51,000 --> 00:12:52,000
My father is under control.

228
00:12:52,240 --> 00:12:53,559
Whether as a subject or a son,

229
00:12:53,840 --> 00:12:55,000
I cannot abandon him.

230
00:12:57,399 --> 00:12:57,679
Come on.

231
00:12:57,879 --> 00:12:58,559
Take the token.

232
00:12:58,639 --> 00:12:59,159
Go out and find someone.

233
00:12:59,360 --> 00:13:00,519
You'll be killed if you go back now.

234
00:13:00,759 --> 00:13:01,519
Let's go out first.

235
00:13:01,600 --> 00:13:02,320
Then we'll find a way.

236
00:13:04,080 --> 00:13:04,399
Chase them.

237
00:13:05,080 --> 00:13:05,360
Stop.

238
00:13:05,360 --> 00:13:05,960
Take her away.

239
00:13:06,080 --> 00:13:06,519
Stop.

240
00:13:06,519 --> 00:13:06,759
Gu Jiachen.

241
00:13:06,759 --> 00:13:07,480
Protect the Crown Prince.

242
00:13:12,159 --> 00:13:14,120
Sister, survive.

243
00:13:43,679 --> 00:13:44,039
Watch out!

244
00:13:44,279 --> 00:13:45,039
They're using cold arrows!

245
00:13:52,279 --> 00:13:53,240
By order of the Consort,

246
00:13:53,480 --> 00:13:54,200
anyone who kills the witch

247
00:13:54,440 --> 00:13:56,039
will be rewarded with wealth and title!

248
00:13:57,480 --> 00:13:58,039
My lady,

249
00:13:58,440 --> 00:13:59,600
they're too many!

250
00:14:00,200 --> 00:14:00,720
We...

251
00:14:01,360 --> 00:14:02,519
we can't escape!

252
00:14:02,519 --> 00:14:03,000
Fear not.

253
00:14:03,720 --> 00:14:04,799
Even in the direst straits,

254
00:14:05,039 --> 00:14:05,480
there's always

255
00:14:05,840 --> 00:14:06,720
a way out.
